# Reference-rot detector, cron form. cron mails any output, and the detector
# prints its one verdict line whenever something has rotted (and nothing at all
# when --quiet and clean), so a quiet mailbox means a healthy fleet.
MAILTO=tiagobeltraoacioli@gmail.com
17 * * * * /opt/bloch/reference-integrity/rot-detector.sh --quiet 2>&1

# Belt and braces: once a day, prove the DERIVATION still agrees with reality,
# which catches drift the peer check alone would miss (e.g. a unit added by
# hand with a hand-typed peer list).
23 6 * * * /opt/bloch/reference-integrity/derive-peers.sh check 2>&1
